    "summary": "Tyranids errata: The Swarmlord's Malign Presence becomes Lord of Deceit (Aura). While The Swarmlord is your WARLORD, a Stratagem your opponent uses on one of their own units within 12\" of it costs them 1CP more for that use. A designer's note says this ability overrides the Lord of Deceit in the June 2024 Balance Dataslate. The June 2026 Tyranids pack already gives Malign Presence a once-per-turn wording without the WARLORD condition, so the official sources for this version disagree.",
